			"notes": "New:\nAdded chunks for coal, charcoal and nether coal. Can be crafted from and back into their respective coals. \nX5 Tnt that has 5 times bigger explosion.\n\nChanged:\nColored glass trapdoors don't need golden tool to collect anymore, to match vanilla glass trapdoor.\n\nFixed:\nPlate chestpale armor being unfixable.\nWooden and stone scythe not being craftable.\nWooden scythe not being a valid furnace fuel."
		},
